# Why each package the node host image adds to the base is there (the base
# is explained in packages.why). Name, a tab, the reason. build-image.sh
# fails when an added package is missing here.

# Running the node
crun	Starts the node, the page server and the certificate and download helpers, each in its own container. There is no container daemon

# Firewall
nftables	The firewall: from outside, only ports 22, 80 and 443 are reachable
nftables-openrc	Loads the firewall rules at boot
libnftnl	Required by nftables
libmnl	Required by nftables
jansson	Required by nftables
gmp	Required by nftables
readline	Required by nftables
